  "notes": "Shapes and structure — the finished patch the demo builds.\n\nCoordinate Field on ANGLE, quantised and twisted, meets a Polygon star on Video Maths set to MAX; Symmetry folds the result, Grid repeats it, and the Colorizer and Chroma colour it. The movement is the field’s SCROLL and nothing else."
